# Keep the repository LF: the working tree was switching between CRLF and LF
# per file and per machine, which made diffs and the copies of .css that the
# bundle inline noisy. This does not make the build byte-reproducible across
# operating systems (esbuild output still differs a little), and nothing gates
# on that.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.svg text eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gif binary
